flowchart LR
    passdb[pass encrypted store]
    atelier[Atelier custody and proxy]
    standin[Local stand-in token]
    client[Local client]
    upstream[Provider upstream]
    manager[Local process manager]

    manager -->|start first| atelier
    manager -->|configure endpoint| client
    passdb -->|auth bundle| atelier
    atelier -->|rotated bundle back to pass| passdb
    atelier -->|mint scoped token| standin
    standin -->|local bearer| client
    client -->|unsigned upstream request plus stand-in| atelier
    atelier -->|inject provider credentials| upstream
    upstream -->|response| atelier
    atelier -->|response without provider tokens| client

    passdb -.->|session-cookie jar| atelier
    client -->|usage read plus usage-scoped stand-in| atelier
    atelier -.->|fetch settings with cookies, final hop only| upstream
    upstream -.->|settings page| atelier
    atelier -.->|parsed usage meters, no cookies| client
